{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04Y3", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0e22e766ca212eb6c180c2337fc58e026a9468898f1929bb51b89b47e2b02aeb", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA morphism of groupoids in algebraic spaces gives an associated morphism\nof quotient stacks.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:908433c1c1cd67979e998f1b234287ddbe3f60670cb5193334910fb073dfebaa", "unit_id": "tag:04Y3:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04Y3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$f : (U, R, s, t, c) \\to (U', R', s', t', c')$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$1$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n[f] : [U/R] \\longrightarrow [U'/R'].\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quotient-stack-functorial}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f5b9a9475018836151e1793ec318ff456abb507caf9054624c5c5d98bdaf5c0c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c90bec274f8a9315ddcf9b6b1560b306adf4a0624725876ca751a82482ededf4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of\ngroupoids in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0005>.\nThen <MATH_0006> induces a canonical <MATH_0007>-morphism of quotient stacks\n<MATH_0008>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4db95d43018f37ed3d23ca8a56aaebfa3815152d54ab1fae367bd8d7255e5687", "unit_id": "tag:046Q:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04Y3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$[U/_{\\!p}R]$", "MATH_0002": "$[U'/_{\\!p}R']$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$1$", "MATH_0006": "$[U/_{\\!p}R] \\to [U'/_{\\!p}R']$", "MATH_0007": "$[U'/R']$", "MATH_0008": "$[U/_{\\!p}R] \\to [U'/R']$", "MATH_0009": "$[U/_{\\!p}R] \\to [U/R]$", "MATH_0010": "$[U/R] \\to [U'/R']$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-quotient-stack}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-lemma-stackify-groupoids-universal-property}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:42a2f4e422687bb7e5be92dbb7c998ff3035de8a4acb61216ef14a56c2029966", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:25d1ad51a82342296b6ea2bd9dd72bb336bdbece35f101eae47da77957395e0a", "source_text": "Denote <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> the categories fibred\nin groupoids over the base site <MATH_0003> associated to the\nfunctors (<REF_0001>). It is clear that <MATH_0004> defines\na <MATH_0005>-morphism <MATH_0006> which we can compose\nwith the stackyfication functor for <MATH_0007> to get <MATH_0008>.\nThen, by the universal property of the stackyfication functor\n<MATH_0009>, see\nStacks, Lemma <REF_0002>\nwe get <MATH_0010>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a9a6b33558f538940af7366ffe94fd6ade447a136de7102dd87de21b4bb72f0d", "unit_id": "tag:046Q:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04Y3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : (U, R, s, t, c) \\to (U', R', s', t', c')$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$T$", "MATH_0005": "$T$", "MATH_0006": "$B$", "MATH_0007": "$U'' = U \\times_{f, U', t'} R'$", "MATH_0008": "$T$", "MATH_0009": "$(u, r')$", "MATH_0010": "$f(u) = t'(r')$", "MATH_0011": "$R'' = R \\times_{f \\circ s, U', t'} R'$", "MATH_0012": "$T$", "MATH_0013": "$(r, r')$", "MATH_0014": "$f(s(r)) = t'(r')$", "MATH_0015": "$s'' : R'' \\to U''$", "MATH_0016": "$s''(r, r') = (s(r), r')$", "MATH_0017": "$t'' : R'' \\to U''$", "MATH_0018": "$t''(r, r') = (t(r), c'(f(r), r'))$", "MATH_0019": "$c'' : R'' \\times_{s'', U'', t''} R'' \\to R''$", "MATH_0020": "$c''((r_1, r'_1), (r_2, r'_2)) = (c(r_1, r_2), r'_2)$", "MATH_0021": "$c''$", "MATH_0022": "$s''(r_1, r'_1) = t''(r_2, r'_2)$", "MATH_0023": "$c''$", "MATH_0024": "$e''$", "MATH_0025": "$e''(u, r) = (e(u), r)$", "MATH_0026": "$(r, r')$", "MATH_0027": "$(i(r), c'(f(r), r'))$", "MATH_0028": "$B$", "MATH_0029": "$U'' \\to U$", "MATH_0030": "$R'' \\to R$", "MATH_0031": "$g : (U'', R'', s'', t'', c'') \\to (U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0032": "$B$", "MATH_0033": "$U'' \\to U'$", "MATH_0034": "$(u, r') \\mapsto s'(r')$", "MATH_0035": "$R'' \\to U'$", "MATH_0036": "$(r, r') \\mapsto s'(r')$", "MATH_0037": "$(U'', R'', s'', t'', c'')$", "MATH_0038": "$U'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quotient-stack-functorial}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\item", "STRUCT_0008": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0009": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0010": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:71c3a65d9925c67fe3cb7f90ab987766bc07db92d4c75d65d3fa47677e